'''Silver Swirly Axe is''' a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that was awarded to the player who finished '''2nd''' in the [[Christmas Event 2021]] '''Coin-Collecting''' Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Silver Swirly Axe has the same appearance as [[Swirly Axe]], but replacing the red color with a shiny silver coloring.

== Trivia ==
*Other variants of this include [[Gold Swirly Axe]], [[Bronze Swirly Axe]], and [[Blue Swirly Axe]].
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*The sole owner of this knife is [https://www.roblox.com/users/305232928/profile '''iGoa_t'''].

